  "aiContextParagraph": "As the 2027 general elections approach, President Bola Tinubu has intensified campaign activities to secure support for the All Progressives Congress (APC). Following a recent rally in Ibadan, the president received endorsements for several political associates while engaging with regional groups. During his visit, he acknowledged national events, including a recent boat accident in Bayelsa State. The campaign event drew scrutiny from the camp of Governor Seyi Makinde, whose organization criticized the turnout and the president’s administration. Meanwhile, internal party efforts are expanding nationwide; governors and political groups in Gombe, Yobe, and Kogi have publicly urged citizens to support the president’s platform. Despite these efforts, some political figures have expressed skepticism regarding the party's electoral prospects, citing potential challenges in various regions of the country as the political landscape shifts toward the 2027 cycle.",
